<h1>09 · BACK 返回归还、回击反抗、抑制与回溯 (BACK: Return, Retaliation, Restraint & Retrospection)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本页共收录 <b>102</b> 个短语动词独立义项 • 已实现 <b>【单一精准中文释义 ⇔ 对应单字替代动词 ⇔ 英文特定定义】</b> 一对一严格对齐</p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterSeparability('all')">全部语法类型</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterSeparability('Separable')">🟢 仅看可拆分 (v.+O+adv.)</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterSeparability('Inseparable')">🔵 仅看不可拆分</button><button class='sub-pill' onclick="filterSeparability('Intransitive')">🟠 仅看丕及物</button><span style='color:#99f6e4;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01 原路返回、归还、偿还与恢复 (59)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02 回击、顶嘴、退缩食言与依靠 (21)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03 抑制情感、隐瞒、阻碍与削减回想 (22)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_原路返回、归还、偿还与恢复 (Return, Restoration & Repayment — '回到原处')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 59 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>恢复，重新上台</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>acquire, recover</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> recover something or somebody that appeared to be lost<div class='ex-sent'>“We got back the money after we threatened to sue the company”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>回来，恢复，送回</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>revenge, avenge</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take revenge or even out a score<div class='ex-sent'>“I cannot accept the defeat--I want to get even”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>回去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>recur, return</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> return in thought or speech to something<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to go back (return in thought or speech to something).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>创始，发明，发起</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>originate, initiate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> belong to an earlier time<div class='ex-sent'>“This story dates back 200 years”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 1/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>送还</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>return, convey</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> bring back to the point of departure<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to take back (bring back to the point of departure).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>恢复</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>settle, contend</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> get one's revenge for a wrong or an injury<div class='ex-sent'>“I finally settled with my old enemy”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>回去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>recover, recuperate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> regain a former condition after a financial loss<div class='ex-sent'>“We expect the stocks to recover to $2.90”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>back on</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>违约</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>renege, revoke</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> fail to fulfill a promise or obligation<div class='ex-sent'>“She backed out of her promise”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>回来，在记忆中重现，复辟</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>return, reappear</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be restored<div class='ex-sent'>“Her old vigor returned”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 2/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>再拿到手，取回，恢复</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repossess, regain</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> regain possession of something<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to take back (regain possession of something).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 3/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>提醒，使想起，引起</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>remind, cause</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause someone to remember the past<div class='ex-sent'>“This photo takes me back to the good old days”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 4/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>咽，淹没，吞没</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>swallow, unsay</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take back what one has said<div class='ex-sent'>“He swallowed his words”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 5/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>移置，替换，转移</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>displace</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move text to the previous line; in printing<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to take back (move text to the previous line).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 6/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>讲，叙述，使互相关联</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>relate, resume</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> resume a relationship with someone after an interruption, as in a wife taking back her husband<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to take back (resume a relationship with someone after an interruption, as in a wife taking back her husband).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>回来，复辟，恢复</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>retort, repay</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> answer back<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to come back (answer back).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>在记忆中重现</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>even</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> even the score, in sports<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to come back (even the score, in sports).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 1/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>往回走，翻回到，折转</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>backtrack, return</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> retrace one's course<div class='ex-sent'>“The hikers got into a storm and had to turn back”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>放回原处，向后移，倒退</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>replace, place</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put something back where it belongs<div class='ex-sent'>“replace the book on the shelf after you have finished reading it”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>bring <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>拿回来，使回忆起来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>return, convey</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> bring back to the point of departure<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to bring back (bring back to the point of departure).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>归还，恢复，后退</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>refund, return</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> pay back<div class='ex-sent'>“Please refund me my money”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>play <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>重新比赛，重演，繁殖</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>replay, reproduce</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> reproduce (a recording) on a recorder<div class='ex-sent'>“The lawyers played back the conversation to show that their client was innocent”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>花费，总计，等同</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cost, amount</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cost a certain amount<div class='ex-sent'>“My daughter's wedding set me back $20,000”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 2/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>往回走，翻回到</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>revert, return</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> go back to a previous state<div class='ex-sent'>“We reverted to the old rules”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>叫回来，收回，打回电</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>remember, retrieve</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> recall knowledge from memory; have a recollection<div class='ex-sent'>“I can't remember saying any such thing”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>叫回来，收回，打回电</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>recall, withdraw</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to be returned<div class='ex-sent'>“recall the defective auto tires”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>win <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>重新获得</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>acquire, recover</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> recover something or somebody that appeared to be lost<div class='ex-sent'>“We got back the money after we threatened to sue the company”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>叫回来，收回，打回电</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>answer, reply</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> return or repeat a telephone call<div class='ex-sent'>“I am busy right now--can you call back in an hour?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pay <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>报答，报复</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>fix, even</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take vengeance on or get even<div class='ex-sent'>“We'll get them!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pay <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>偿付，报答，报复</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>reward, repay</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> act or give recompense in recognition of someone's behavior or actions<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to pay back (act or give recompense in recognition of someone's behavior or actions).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 3/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>检查，阻止，核对</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>check, arrest</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> hold back, as of a danger or an enemy; check the expansion or influence of<div class='ex-sent'>“Arrest the downward trend”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 4/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>折转</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>dispel, displace</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> force to go away; used both with concrete and metaphoric meanings<div class='ex-sent'>“Drive away potential burglars”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>bring <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>拿回来，使回忆起来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>awaken, wake</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> return to consciousness<div class='ex-sent'>“These pictures bring back sad memories”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>buy <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>再买，买回，买</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repurchase, buy</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> buy what had previously been sold, lost, or given away<div class='ex-sent'>“He bought back the house that his father sold years ago”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 2/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>返回，归还，回来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>return, time</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> return in time<div class='ex-sent'>“the film cut back to an earlier event in the story”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 5/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>折转</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>invert, reverse</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> turn inside out or upside down<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to turn back (turn inside out or upside down).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>force <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>抑制，强忍</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repel, drive</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to move back by force or influence<div class='ex-sent'>“repel the enemy”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>sit <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>向后靠着坐</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>relax, unbend</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> settle into a comfortable sitting position<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to sit back (settle into a comfortable sitting position).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>drive <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>驾车返回，驱车返回，迫使后退</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repel, repulse</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> force or drive back<div class='ex-sent'>“repel the attacker”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>send <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>退还</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>remit, remand</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> refer (a matter or legal case) to another committee or authority or court for decision<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to send back (refer (a matter or legal case) to another committee or authority or court for decision).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>die <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>枯死但根部还活着，顶梢枯死</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>shrivel, shrink</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> suffer from a disease that kills shoots<div class='ex-sent'>“The plants near the garage are dying back”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>drop <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>安置，决定...的位置，养育</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>position</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take position in the rear, as in a military formation or in the line of scrimmage in football<div class='ex-sent'>“The defender dropped back behind his teammate”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>beat <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>击退，抗击，打退</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repel, drive</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to move back by force or influence<div class='ex-sent'>“repel the enemy”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>double <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>把...对折，循原路折回</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>backtrack, return</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> retrace one's course<div class='ex-sent'>“The hikers got into a storm and had to turn back”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>drop <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>退后</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>drag, trail</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> to lag or linger behind<div class='ex-sent'>“But in so many other areas we still are dragging”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>sit <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>不采取行动</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>watch</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be inactive or indifferent while something is happening<div class='ex-sent'>“Don't just sit by while your rights are violated!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>throw <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>反射</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>flip, toss</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> throw back with a quick, light motion<div class='ex-sent'>“She tossed back her head”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>carry <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>减去，扣掉，减少</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>subtract, deduct</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> deduct a loss or an unused credit from taxable income for a prior period<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to carry back (deduct a loss or an unused credit from taxable income for a prior period).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>kick <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>踢回</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>pay</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> pay a kickback; make an illegal payment<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to kick back (pay a kickback).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>feed <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>反作用，反馈</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>resubmit, render</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> submit (information) again to a program or automatic system<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to feed back (submit (information) again to a program or automatic system).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>feed <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>计划，打算，建议</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>propose, suggest</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> respond to a query or outcome<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to feed back (respond to a query or outcome).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>hang <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>拖累，拖拉，沉重缓慢地走</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>drag, trail</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> to lag or linger behind<div class='ex-sent'>“But in so many other areas we still are dragging”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>strike <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>回击</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>retaliate, strike</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make a counterattack and return like for like, especially evil for evil<div class='ex-sent'>“The Empire strikes back”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>rear <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>后跃</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>rear</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> rear backwards on its hind legs<div class='ex-sent'>“the frightened horse reared back”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>flash <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>返回，归还，回来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>return, time</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> return in time<div class='ex-sent'>“the film cut back to an earlier event in the story”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>rear <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>后跃</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>startle, jump</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> start with anger or resentment or in protest<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to rear back (start with anger or resentment or in protest).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>lean <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>仰靠着，向后靠</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>recline, lean</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move the upper body backwards and down<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to lean back (move the upper body backwards and down).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>knock <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使大吃一惊，<口>使花费掉</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cost, amount</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cost a certain amount<div class='ex-sent'>“My daughter's wedding set me back $20,000”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>bounce <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>受挫折后恢复原状</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>better, improve</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> improve in health<div class='ex-sent'>“He got well fast”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>toss <span class='pt-highlight'>back</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>掷，弹，轻击</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>flip, toss</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> throw back with a quick, light motion<div class='ex-sent'>“She tossed back her head”</div></td></tr>
